            "question": "How does sizing work?",
            "answer": "<p>Each size is listed by age, from 2-5 months to 30-36 months. The fit is roomy, so if your little one is between sizes, choose the larger one. Tap “Size guide” above for the measurements.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it warm enough?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. It's a cozy plush layer, made for cool evenings, winter outings and the bedtime wind-down. Add light layers underneath as needed, and always follow safe-sleep guidance for your baby's age.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I wash it?",
            "answer": "<p>Wash it inside out on a gentle, cool cycle and follow the care label. That keeps it soft wash after wash.</p>"
